  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" alt=\"關於標頭\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8djzQBruLto\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@nightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnightbeam.gitbook.io%252fremnants%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Documentation&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=read-the-docs&logoColor=white\"></a></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.1em;line-height:1.6\">誕生於地獄深處，<strong>遺骸（Remnants）</strong>融合了不死族的韌性與古代戰鬥大師的致命精準度。無論你是經驗豐富的冒險者，還是尋求刺激、尋找下一場大型戰鬥的挑戰者，此模組都能為你帶來心跳加速的體驗。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\" width=\"240\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" alt=\"功能特色\"></p>\n<h2><strong>遺骸·Ossukage</strong>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p>一位神秘的骸骨忍者，以速度、欺敵戰術與致命的精準度掌控戰場。</p>\n<h3>技能</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>暗影衝刺：</strong>快速的高速度衝鋒攻擊，可穿透玩家。</li>\n<li><strong>苦無連射：</strong>投擲旋轉的苦無飛鏢，並配有自訂的飛行動畫。</li>\n<li><strong>傳送突擊：</strong>短暫隱身後出現在毫無防備的玩家背後進行攻擊。</li>\n<li><strong>相位轉移模式：</strong>進入狂暴狀態時，會獲得新的攻擊模式與提升的速度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>戰鬥體驗</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>非常適合用於迷宮競技場或遊戲後期的進度推進。</li>\n<li>包含<strong>自訂材質、模型、動畫與音效</strong>（衝刺、攻擊、主題音樂）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>骷髏奴僕</strong></h2>\n<p>Ossukage 身邊伴隨著不死奴僕，在戰鬥中提供支援。</p>\n<h3>戰鬥職責</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>近戰骷髏戰士：</strong>以高速移動衝向敵人進行近戰攻擊。</li>\n<li><strong>守護奴僕：</strong>在 Boss 處於脆弱階段時提供保護。</li>\n<li><strong>波次召喚：</strong>根據 Boss 的生命值閾值召喚額外奴僕。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>變異老鼠</strong></h2>\n<p>穿梭於廢墟、洞穴與迷宮之中，即使在 Boss 戰之前也為玩家增添危險。</p>\n<h3>變體</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>普通鼠、灰鼠、黃鼠、藍鼠</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<h2>支援與連結</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>官方文件： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnightbeam.gitbook.io%252fremnants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://nightbeam.gitbook.io/remnants</a></li>\n<li>Discord： <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK</a></li>\n<li>GitHub： <a href=\"https://github.com/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MeherBenSalem</a></li>\n<li>CurseForge： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects</a></li>\n<li>Modrinth： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您發現任何錯誤或有新功能建議，請開啟 Issue 或在 Discord 上留言。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p>\n</div>",
